or: var(--color-text-secondary);\">單選題</p></div>某電池表示為 Fe(s)|Fe²⁺(aq)||Ag⁺(aq)|Ag(s)。下列何者正確？<div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"A-_r_fb_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"A\" id=\"A-_r_fb_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>A. Fe²⁺ 在陰極被還原</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"B-_r_fd_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"B\" id=\"B-_r_fd_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>B. 電子由 Ag 電極流向 Fe 電極</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"C-_r_ff_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"C\" id=\"C-_r_ff_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>C. 電池總反應為 Fe+2Ag⁺→Fe²⁺+2Ag</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"D-_r_fh_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"D\" id=\"D-_r_fh_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. Ag 電極是負極</label></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查與查看解析</span></button></div></div>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">本章的學習目標不只是能算出電壓，而是看到任何一個電化電池時，都能從半反應推導出<span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">哪裡氧化、哪裡還原、電子如何移動、離子為何需要移動，以及電池能否自發運作</strong></span>。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">課綱查核參考：<span class=\"Trigger-y4ejT1\" data-d-component=\"popover-trigger\" data-d-inline=\"\" data-d-inline-text=\"\" role=\"presentation\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\"><a class=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.ceec.edu.tw/files/file_pool/1/0N118343854402770688/111%E5%AD%B8%E5%B9%B4%E5%BA%A6%E8%B5%B7%E9%81%A9%E7%94%A8%E5%88%86%E7%A7%91%E6%B8%AC%E9%A9%97%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%B8%E8%80%83%E7%A7%91%E8%80%83%E8%A9%A6%E8%AA%AA%E6%98%8E%28%E5%AE%9A%E7%A8%BF%29-1101.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-inline=\"\" data-d-text-decoration=\"underline-dotted\">大考中心分科測驗化學考科考試說明</span><span class=\"ms-1\"><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"InlineIcon-U9ZpYM\" data-d-component=\"icon\" data-d-inline=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M16.243 6.757a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7.072a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4.657L8.464 16.95a1 